PLAIN-LANGUAGE SUMMARY (not the licence - the terms below govern)

  You MAY:
    - use this SDK, free of charge, in any application or game you build,
      including one you sell, as long as it connects to Praxsuite
    - read, modify and fork the source
    - publish your fork or your changes
    - build and share extensions, wrappers and integrations

  You MAY NOT:
    - sell, license or host this software itself as a product or service
    - use it to build a competing backend platform, or to connect to one
    - remove the attribution

  In short: build whatever you like on top of Praxsuite. Do not repackage this
  work as someone else's product, and do not use it to power a competitor.
