1. DEFINITIONS

   "Software" means this SDK: its source, documentation and any build artifact
   produced from it.

   "Praxsuite Platform" means the hosted or licensed Praxsuite service operated
   or authorised by Tesseract Softwares SpA.

   "Your Application" means software you develop that uses the Software to
   communicate with the Praxsuite Platform - a web app, a Node service, a mobile
   app, or any other program.

   "Competing Service" means any product or service that provides
   backend-as-a-service, database-as-a-service, application-platform or similar
   functionality substantially equivalent to the Praxsuite Platform, whether
   offered commercially or free of charge.

